      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T20:11:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should this revision gating be determined by the PE?  That would centralize the check and also ensure that any other callers of pd_send_alert_msg() can\u0027t cause the same issue",
      "revId": "ae1d24f272ce32340947f9bcc769f64b5f3540a4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "81f8ed85_53411fe8",
        "filename": "common/usbc/usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 3931,
      "author": {
        "id": 1527433
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T20:22:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think so. Alerts were added in PD Rev 3.0 so we should still be able to use pd_send_alert_msg to alert PD 3.0 partners of some events. We should only be gating extended alert events from PD 3.0 partners because that type of event was added in PD 3.1.\n\nIf we were to gate in the PE, I think it should work by just clearing bits 0-3 and 31 if the partner is REV 3.0 because those bits were reserved in the 3.0 spec. Then if the alert with 3.1 bit cleared is all 0s, block the message. Either approach works for me.",
      "parentUuid": "2e6cb29f_b6d3d292",
      "revId": "ae1d24f272ce32340947f9bcc769f64b5f3540a4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a352c8f9_ba08939a",
        "filename": "common/usbc/usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 3931,
      "author": {
        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-01T20:38:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d lean towards having the PE drop extended alert messages for the partner who is less than PD 3.1, in part because this CL has the same logic in 4 locations and we could find ourselves needing that same logic later for other alerts.",
      "parentUuid": "81f8ed85_53411fe8",
      "revId": "ae1d24f272ce32340947f9bcc769f64b5f3540a4",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
